{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2021-10-11 06:02:00', 'title': 'DAVITA CLIMATE ACTION GOALS APPROVED BY THE SCIENCE BASED TARGET INITIATIVE', 'text': 'DENVER, OCT. 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DAVITA FURTHERS COMMITMENT TO CLIMATE ACTION GOALS WITH VALIDATION FROM THE SCIENCE BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE (SBTI). THE ORGANIZATION HAS APPROVED TWO GOALS: SUPPLY CHAIN PARTNERS REPRESENTING 70% OF EMISSIONS WILL SET CLIMATE CHANGE GOALS BY 2025 REDUCE ITS CARBON EMISSIONS BY 50% BY 2025 "OUR ENVIRONMENTAL GOALS PROACTIVELY ADDRESS OUR CONTRIBUTION TO CLIMATE CHANGE," SAID MISHA PALECEK, CHIEF TRANSFORMATION OFFICER FOR DAVITA.'}